--  * recurring tasks + completion log (complete_task)
--  * maintenance register (next due worked out from last done + frequency)
--  * digital logs (autoclave, washer-disinfector, emergency drugs, fridge, legionella, X-ray)
--  * policy library + per-person review sign-off
--  * training / recruitment checklist per staff member (hr_checklist)
--  * extra audit types (IPC, clinical records, antibiotic, patient survey, disability)
--  * alerts_due() now also covers tasks and maintenance
-- Run once in the Supabase SQL editor after 01-05. Policy and audit text are TEMPLATES for expert review.
